{"parentUuid":"633ea977-aa9e-4936-8d0f-8e6c0e33063b","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a9164c81ffbd93f27","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CeZMePVyJQSWfVrHgetbi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here is a summary of what was built and verified.\n\n**File created:** `/Users/blake/Desktop/MIT/OpenWave/M8.5C2_BUILD/build/gates.py`\n\n**Contents:**\n\n- **`run_gate_1(sectors, rungs)`** -- G-LIN wiring check. For each (sector, rung), assembles the diagonal linear operator A = diag(-n(n+2)), computes K_defect (||A - A^H||_2) and J_defect (max|Im lambda(A)|), checks both are below 100 * eps_mach * ||A||_2. Mutation arm injects anti-Hermitian coupling between two modes (+1.0 off-diagonal, -1.0 transpose). Writes one GATE record per (sector, rung).\n\n- **`run_gate_2(sectors, rungs)`** -- G-LABEL Casimir/eigenvalue labeling check. Two sub-checks: (1) walks the eigenvalue array from `laplacian_eigenvalues()` and verifies every mode at level n has eigenvalue exactly n(n+2); (2) synthesis-analysis round-trip test using a random coefficient vector at 2N-exact Hopf quadrature. Mutation arm mislabels one eigenvalue from n(n+2) to (n+1)(n+3). Writes one GATE record per (sector, rung).\n\n- **`run_gate_10(exercised_arenas, nonlinear_arenas)`** -- Executable partition coverage. Checks that every arena in the registry was exercised, no nonlinear evaluation on prohibited arenas, no out-of-registry nonlinear calls. Two mutation arms: (1) injects a fake out-of-registry nonlinear call; (2) removes one arena from the exercised set. Writes one GATE record.\n\n- **`ArenaTracker`** helper class -- accumulates exercised/nonlinear arena sets across gates 1-9 for Gate 10.\n\n- **`_arena_id(rho, N)`** helper -- generates 'A-R0-N{N}' for R0, 'A-SECTOR-{rho}-N{N}' for nontrivial sectors.\n\n**Test results (all passed):**\n\n| Gate | Test config | Parent | Mutation | Key measurements |\n|------|------------|--------|----------|-----------------|\n| G1-LIN | R0, N=24 | GREEN (K=0, J=0) | RED (K_mut=2.0 >> thr=1.4e-11) | 60 modes, ||A||=624 |\n| G2-LABEL | R0, N=24 | GREEN (label_err=0, rt_err=8e-15) | RED (mut_err=27.0) | Mutation at level 12 |\n| G10-COVERAGE | Full registry | GREEN (82/82 covered) | RED (both mutations caught) | 82 registry arenas |"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":171,"cache_read_input_tokens":64850,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":171,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeZMeKswg39H82dc5AYVW","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"02b6a413-1288-45c6-9996-112a1f35977f","timestamp":"2026-08-30T17:51:02.194Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/blake/Desktop/MIT/OpenWave/M8.5C2_BUILD","sessionId":"df404d7f-30da-41ec-8c3e-12ef3f92c53b","version":"2.1.251","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-orbiting-pelican"}
